Evidence boundary: source assignment, grant, and command authority remain test fixtures. Both source commands are Cancel operations for absent Message IDs and return NOT_FOUND; this run does not perform a same-Target business queue mutation or Producer send. It does not establish production placement/bootstrap, Claim/Admission/Producer ownership failure, uncertain Store writes, shared-channel teardown, broader process-crash recovery, the full D2 matrix, or centralized validation. D2 remains IN_PROGRESS / PENDING_CENTRAL_VALIDATION.

